      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تحدّر الدَّمْعُ</span></b>  (S, K *) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تحادر</span></b>  (A) <i>The
tears descended gently,</i> or <i>little by little.</i> (S, A,
K. *) And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَلَى لِحْيَتِهِ</span> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَأَيْتُ المَطَرَ يَتَحَادَرُ</span></b>  <i>I saw
the rain descending and dropping upon his beard.</i>
(TA.)

